---
# Juniper Mist 802.11r Fast Roaming 配置
---
method: PUT
endpoint: /api/v1/orgs/{org_id}/sites/{site_id}/wlan
description: 配置 802.11r FT（Fast BSS Transition）漫游
auth: api_token
headers:
  Content-Type: application/json
body:
  ft:
    enabled: true
    method: "ft-over-ds"
    mobility_domain: "{{ mobility_domain }}"
    r0_key_timeout: 60
  ap_selection:
    band: "both"
    band_steering: true
  band_steering:
    enabled: true
    cycle_count: 5
    cycle_period_min: 10
    snr_diff_threshold: 20
  sticky_client:
    enabled: true
    min_data_rssi: "-75"
